  matrice de dithering repart a 0 a chaque tranche }
 Jobs:=NVSliceJobs; Sl:=(NVH+Jobs-1) Div Jobs; If Sl<1 Then Sl:=1;
 For Y:=0 To NVH-1 Do For X:=0 To NVW-1 Do Begin
  V:=P^[2*(Y*NVW+X)]+P^[2*(Y*NVW+X)+1]*256;
